          "source": "netlist",
          "quote": "(comp (ref \"C3\") (value \"100nF\") (footprint \"Capacitor_SMD:C_0805_2012Metric\")"
        },
        {
          "source": "netlist",
          "quote": "(comp (ref \"U3\") (value \"LM1117-5.0\") (footprint \"Package_TO_SOT_SMD:SOT-223-3_TabPin2\")"
        },
        {
          "source": "netlist",
          "quote": "(net (code \"1\") (name \"+5V\") ... (node (ref \"C3\") (pin \"1\") (pintype \"passive\"))"
        },
        {
          "source": "netlist",
          "quote": "(net (code \"5\") (name \"GND\") ... (node (ref \"C3\") (pin \"2\") (pintype \"passive\"))"
        }
      ],
      "impact": "The 5V rail may oscillate or be unstable, causing the ATtiny microcontrollers (U1/U2) and other 5V logic to malfunction or reset.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    }
  ],
  "summary": "The design contains a clear anomaly: the LM1117-5.0 regulator's output capacitor C3 is 100nF, far below the datasheet-required minimum of 10µF, which will likely cause an unstable 5V rail."
}

